<title>UK: Australian bulker, due to load sugar, in Netherlands.</title>
<headline>Australian bulker, due to load sugar, in Netherlands.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia-flag bulk carrier Mrs Pioneer, 21,250 dwt, arrived at Delfzjil in the Netherlands Tuesday under tow, Lloyd's Shipping Intelligence Service reported.</p>
<p>The vessel had been proceeding to Eemshaven from the builder's yard in Harlingen, to load sugar, when it reported a small fire in its engine-room.</p>
<p>The fire was brought under control and there were no reports of injuries.</p>
</text>
